    (uuid 7ca19895-7d31-5f42-9818-993c1ae81a1d))
  (text "Four-layer copper, component pads and net identities follow the preserved CAM export.\nSheet symbols open the functional reference pages. Global labels connect pages.\nDedicated UART0 RX/TX remain reserved. Feeder GPIO and vacuum ADC choices are provisional.\nRead README.md, recovery.json, validation.json and PIN_AUDIT.md before modifications."
